_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">Output</span><span id="lstnumberx28.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx28.20" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">only</span><span id="lstnumberx28.21" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx28.22" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">JSON</span><span id="lstnumberx28.23" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">.</span>
