eq p" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q\neq p</annotation></semantics></math>. The score of 0.75/1.0 reflects the partial correctness of the solution, deducting for the incomplete presentation. The main issue is not mathematical correctness but rather the incomplete expression of the solution”</p>
