pplication/x-tex">\sum_{k=0}^{n-1}(-1)^{k}E(n,k)</annotation></semantics></math> counts alternating permutations, nor any justification of the claimed identity. The limited credit reflects that the initial idea (encoding alternating permutations via local inequalities) is relevant but not developed into a correct solution.”</p>
