)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{k}(-1)^{n-1-k}E(n,k)</annotation></semantics></math>) nor provide a proof via generating functions, sign- reversing involution, or another valid method. Since only preliminary observations are given without any completed reasoning leading to the stated formula, only minimal partial credit is warranted.”</p>
